{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30412","headline":"旅馆闻雁别友人 · 赵嘏","name":"旅馆闻雁别友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路遶秋塘首独搔，背羣燕雁正呼号。\n故关何处重相失，碧落有云终自高。\n旅宿去缄他日恨，单飞谁见此生劳。\n行衣湿尽千山雪，肠断金笼好羽毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}